83	   * Price per GB per month for extra ROOT DISK (admin setting
84	   * `extra_disk_gb_price_cents`). Priced over the term exactly like the dedicated
85	   * IP add-on, so the maths here matches lib/order.ts orderQuote byte-for-byte.
86	   * 0 hides the upsell entirely.
